msgstr "max."

#: olc_webportalv2/templates/primer_finder/validator_request.html:172
#: olc_webportalv2/templates/primer_finder/validator_request.html:268
msgid ""
"Identity is the minimum accepted percentage. Differences are mismatches plus "
